{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>And you shall bind them for a sign upon your hand.</b> These are the tefillin of the arm. And the tradition received is that this 'hand' is the left hand, because the left is called יד, in the manner of what is written (Isaiah 48): ״אף ידי יסדה ארץ וימיני טפחה שמים״, and it is written (Judges 5): ״ידה ליתד תשלחנה וימינה להלמות עמלים״, and likewise it is written (Exodus 13): ״והיה לאות על ידכה״, with an added ה, and our Rabbis of blessed memory interpreted [this as]: the יד is כהה, that is, the left. And the placement on the arm — our Rabbis of blessed memory received that it is above, on the upper part of the arm, which is opposite the heart; just as the tefillin of the head are at the height of the head, so too the tefillin of the arm are at the height of the arm, which is the upper part of the arm. For if you were to say it is placed on the hand itself, in the place upon the hand called the קנה, it would not be opposite the heart; and since the tradition comes that it is opposite the heart, therefore we must place it in the place called the זרוע, which is above the קנה — as it is written (Job 31): ״ואזרועי מקנה תשבר״. And likewise our Rabbis of blessed memory interpreted: Beloved are Israel, for the Holy One, blessed be He, surrounded them with tefillin on their heads and tefillin on their arms. And they further said: ״וקשרתם לאות״ — that there be a sign in the tying; this is the knot of the tefillin, which our Rabbis of blessed memory received as a halakhah given to Moses at Sinai." "<b>And they shall be for frontlets between your eyes.</b> Above the forehead, in the place of the brain, which is the place of the intellect. And our Rabbis of blessed memory interpreted: ״בין עיניך״ — the place where one makes a bald spot, from what is written (Deuteronomy 14): ״ולא תשימו קרחה בין עיניכם״. And they further interpreted: ״לטטפות בין עיניך״ — as long as they are between your eyes they shall be two; and therefore it is forbidden to put on the tefillin of the head first and afterwards that of the arm."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 6, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:46:05.875249945Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}